<title>JAPAN: Ashikaga Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ashikaga Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    97.43		vs	  139.47</p>
<p> Operating	   20.16		vs	   27.62</p>
<p> Current		4.64		vs	    9.95</p>
<p> Net		    4.62		vs	    1.96</p>
<p> EPS		    7.42 yen	  vs	    3.14 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    622 million	  vs	 622 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Ashikaga Bank Ltd is a Tochigi-based regional bank.</p>
</text>
